Hash MapsArraysRing Buffers <p>Key-value storage for arbitrary data <pre><code>struct {
    __uint(type, BPF_MAP_TYPE_HASH);
    __type(key, u32);
    __type(value, struct data_t);
    __uint(max_entries, 1024);
} my_map SEC(".maps");
</code></pre></p> <p>Fixed-size indexed storage <pre><code>struct {
    __uint(type, BPF_MAP_TYPE_ARRAY);
    __type(key, u32);
    __type(value, u64);
    __uint(max_entries, 256);
} counters SEC(".maps");
</code></pre></p> <p>Efficient event streaming to userspace <pre><code>struct {
    __uint(type, BPF_MAP_TYPE_RINGBUF);
    __uint(max_entries, 1 &lt;&lt; 24);
} events SEC(".maps");
</code></pre></p>
